WEBVTT

00:00:58.469 --> 00:01:01.205
All right? Which means, when it comes to perception,

00:01:01.205 --> 00:01:08.000
we're all like this frog.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:08.912
(Laughter)

00:01:08.912 --> 00:01:12.307
Right? It's getting information. It's generating behavior

00:01:12.307 --> 00:01:16.775
that's useful. (Laughter)

00:01:16.775 --> 00:01:23.807
(Laughter)

00:01:23.807 --> 00:01:29.789
(Video) Man: Ow! Ow! (Laughter) (Applause)

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:32.501
BL: And sometimes, when things don't go our way,